#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h3-fs\">\n"
"                                                Established in 1894, The "
"Crown Fine Art Museum houses over 15,000 works of art spanning eight "
"centuries. Our mission is to preserve and showcase exceptional visual art "
"for visitors of all ages. From quiet gallery halls to interactive "
"educational workshops, we invite you to experience human creativity at its "
"finest.\n"
"                                            </span>"
msgstr ""

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.view_page_donations
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h3-fs\">Your contribution helps us keep the museum open and "
"accessible to everyone: students, families, researchers, and curious "
"visitors of all ages. Whether it’s a one-time gift or ongoing support, your "
"donation becomes part of the museum’s story—and part of what we pass on to "
"future generations.</span>"
